This is a working _non released_ Text Viewer door for MAXs that allows users
to view, scroll, and download text and ANSI files.

It's HD based, so that your text/ANSI files maybe much bigger than whatever
RAM is currently available.

* NOTE *  There's a slight bug, some of the text is not fully cleared when
scrolling, someone wanna' fix it?

To compile the source, you'll need SAS C 6.X.

To install it, just use sumthin' akin to this:

  KEY  FUNCTION  EXTRAS  LOW  HIGH   PATH/FILENAME
   V      34       0     10   10000  DOORS:VIEW/VIEW/<FILENAME>

ie. <FILENAME> = BBS:TEXT/BULLETIN.TEXT


